      "entries": [
        "Whenever a creature dies within 60 feet of a skulltaker, the skulltaker draws a portion of the creature's bones into its shard storm. The creature must succeed at a DC 42 Will save or rise as a skeletal champion (Pathfinder Monster Core 312) in 1d4 rounds. These skeletal champions are controlled|PC1 by the skulltaker."
